# Catalog.Api — sistemi Aspire AppHost ile başlat (portlar launchSettings'ten; Aspire dashboard'da doğrula)
# REST okuma uçları yok (UI vitrinden okur, agent MCP'den); yazma uçları catalog.write scope ister.
@baseAddress = https://localhost:7052
@identity = https://localhost:5001
@productId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afac
@brandId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa1
@categoryId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa2

### Token al (client_credentials — scope: catalog.write)
POST {{identity}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=ecommerce.bff&client_secret=webshop-secret&scope=catalog.write

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

### Ürün oluştur (catalog.write) — normalde ürünler tedarikçi feed'inden gelir (IngestionAgent)
POST {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Örnek Telefon",
  "description": "Test ürünü",
  "price": 14999.00,
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "brandId": "{{brandId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "imageUrl": null
}

### Ürün güncelle (catalog.write)
PUT {{baseAddress}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "name": "Örnek Telefon v2",
  "description": "Güncellenmiş test ürünü",
  "price": 13999.00,
  "sku": "SKU-0001",
  "brandId": "{{brandId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "imageUrl": null
}